  "description": "Provides strong types and repository access for mongoDB and Azure Cosmos DB, which is both weak typed.\n\n\t\tYou can have all the sources with examples from here:\n\t\thttps://github.com/rammicz/MongoRepo\n\n\t\t- Full async support\n\t\t- Async operation throttling to not overload the DB connection",
  "id": "Rammi.MongoTypeRepository",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-12T14:28:01Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "oFAJktfjBwblirwNyVAT3Ssq4n6nPYRG1Z27Zz6VLWJ92BlJCP/xc5D2SIMDiDzoY30Y7yaxQycrHWSSrHe0qA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 162588,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/rammicz/MongoRepo",
  "published": "2026-06-12T14:24:57.893Z",
  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Throttling fixed: async operations are now actually limited by the configured concurrency cap (previously operations started before the semaphore wait), and faulted operations no longer leak permits.\n\t\t- CancellationToken support: every async repository method accepts an optional trailing CancellationToken, honored while queued on the throttle and forwarded to the driver. Source-compatible; recompile required (binary-breaking).\n\t\t- Batch Save/Update(IEnumerable) now issue a single BulkWrite instead of one ReplaceOne round-trip per item.\n\t\t- GetPagedResultsAsync pages server-side (Skip/Limit) instead of transferring all preceding pages.\n\t\t- Paging filters (Contains/StartsWith/EndsWith) escape user input - fixes regex injection/ReDoS and literal matching of metacharacters.\n\t\t- New ObjectIds use the driver's UTC timestamp convention.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Provides strong types (data model) and repository access for mongo DB or Azure CosmosDB\n\n      Sources here:\n      https://github.com/rammicz/MongoRepo",
  "title": "Strongly typed Mongo / Cosmos repository",
  "verbatimVersion": "10.1.0",
